            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kings 15.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.15.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In the eighteenth year of King Jeroboam Abijah began to reign over Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He reigned for three years in Jerusalem. His mother's name was Micaiah the daughter of Uriel of Gibeah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now there was war between Abijah and Jeroboam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijah went out to battle having an army of valiant men of war, four hundred thousand picked men; and Jeroboam drew up his line of battle against him with eight hundred thousand picked mighty warriors. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abijah stood up on Mount Zemaraim which is in the hill country of Ephraim, and said, “Hear me, O Jeroboam and all Israel! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ought you not to know that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God of Israel gave the kingship over Israel for ever to David and his sons by a covenant of salt? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet Jeroboam the son of Nebat, a servant of Solomon the son of David, rose up and rebelled against his lord; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and certain worthless scoundrels gathered about him and defied Rehoboam the son of Solomon, when Rehoboam was young and irresolute and could not withstand them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And now you think to withstand the kingdom of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in the hand of the sons of David, because you are a great multitude and have with you the golden calves which Jeroboam made you for gods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you not driven out the priests of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the sons of Aaron, and the Levites, and made priests for yourselves like the peoples of other lands? Whoever comes to consecrate himself with a young bull or seven rams becomes a priest of what are no gods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as for us, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is our God, and we have not forsaken him. We have priests ministering to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who are sons of Aaron, and Levites for their service. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They offer to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " every morning and every evening burnt offerings and incense of sweet spices, set out the showbread on the table of pure gold, and care for the golden lampstand that its lamps may burn every evening; for we keep the charge of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God, but you have forsaken him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, God is with us at our head, and his priests with their battle trumpets to sound the call to battle against you. O sons of Israel, do not fight against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your fathers; for you cannot succeed.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboam had sent an ambush around to come on them from behind; thus his troops",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " were in front of Judah, and the ambush was behind them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Judah looked, behold, the battle was before and behind them; and they cried to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the priests blew the trumpets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the men of Judah raised the battle shout. And when the men of Judah shouted, God defeated Jeroboam and all Israel before Abijah and Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The men of Israel fled before Judah, and God gave them into their hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijah and his people slew them with a great slaughter; so there fell slain of Israel five hundred thousand picked men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus the men of Israel were subdued at that time, and the men of Judah prevailed, because they relied upon the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of their fathers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abijah pursued Jeroboam, and took cities from him, Bethel with its villages and Jeshanah with its villages and Ephron",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Another reading is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ephrain",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with its villages. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboam did not recover his power in the days of Abijah; and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " smote him, and he died. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Abijah grew mighty. And he took fourteen wives, and had twenty-two sons and sixteen daughters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of the acts of Abijah, his ways and his sayings, are written in the story of the prophet Iddo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2CH.14",
    "number": "14",
